  "uncertainties": [
    {
      "unitId": "s0055",
      "zh": "要疏如律令。」",
      "issue": "The magical petition ending 如律令 should not be interpreted as an ordinary legal summons. Exact ritual rendering of 要疏 needs specialist checking; avoid inventing an office or person.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0058",
      "zh": "帝幸式乾殿，召公卿入，使黃門令董猛乙太子書及青紙詔曰：「遹書如此，今賜死。」",
      "issue": "乙 may mean reading/marking the document rather than displaying it. Do not change without checking the transmitted reading and usage.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0069",
      "zh": "先是，有童謠曰：「東宮馬子莫聾空，前至臘月纏汝閤。」",
      "issue": "The rhyme’s 馬子 and 聾空 are difficult and may depend on wordplay or a textual variant. Current English is obscure; this review does not license a guessed omen paraphrase.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0077",
      "zh": "自宜城君亡，不見存恤，恆在空室中坐。",
      "issue": "The unexpressed subject of 不見存恤/恆在空室 may continue the mother mentioned immediately before, rather than Yu himself. This needs a source-grounded syntactic decision before any first-person repair.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0087",
      "zh": "須臾中宮遣陳舞見語：'聞汝表陛下為道文乞王，不得王是成國耳。",
      "issue": "\"you got Cheng principality instead\" treats 成國 as an awarded proper principality, unsupported by the immediate context. The reading/segmentation of 不得王是成國耳 needs investigation; do not invent a grant or substitute a new polity.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0091",
      "zh": "中宮遙呼曰：'汝常陛下前持酒可喜，何以不飲？",
      "issue": "持酒可喜 need not mean Yu drank gladly; it can concern presenting/holding wine before the emperor to please him. Preserve uncertainty pending a syntactic check.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0126",
      "zh": "妾私心冀其刻肌刻骨，更思孝道，規為稽顙，正其名號。",
      "issue": "The hoped-for filial repentance is pre-death. I read 規為稽顙 as Jia planning to bow on his behalf and seek restoration, but distinguish that subject allocation from the unequivocal rejection of branding and posthumous repentance.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0154",
      "zh": "爾之逝矣，誰百其形？",
      "issue": "The hundredfold ransom image is clear, but the precise handling of 形 versus the Yellow Bird model 身 should preserve this source’s Chinese rather than silently emend it.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0163",
      "zh": "華髦電逝，戎車雷震。",
      "issue": "華髦 is transmitted here; a standards/plumes interpretation is plausible, but do not silently change the Chinese to 華旄 or pretend the exact equipment term is settled.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0188",
      "zh": "及於繼明宸極，守器春坊，四教不勤，三朝或闕，豹姿未變，鳳德已衰，信惑奸邪，疏斥正士，好屠酤之賤役，耽苑囿之佚遊，可謂靡不有初，鮮克有終者也。",
      "issue": "The untransformed leopard image merits an annotation if expanded; retain the metaphor instead of inventing a specific fable interpretation.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0190",
      "zh": "坎牲之謀已構，斃犬之譖遂行；",
      "issue": "The dead-dog and sacrificial-victim images invoke historical slanders. Exact historical names should be independently established before adding them; the proposed minimal translation deliberately leaves them as images.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    },
    {
      "unitId": "s0197",
      "zh": "掇蜂構隙，歸胙生災。",
      "issue": "The wasp and returned-meat images should be retained; full identification of their historical allusions requires primary passage matching before expanding them.",
      "status": "uncertainty-not-approved-repair"
    }
  ],
  "authorParsingChoices": [
    {
      "unit": "s0126",
      "choice": "Keep subject of the prostration implicit. Correct physical-branding and posthumous errors without asserting whether Jia or Yu bows."
    },
    {
      "unit": "s0154",
      "choice": "Render hundredfold ransom for your person, retaining this source’s 形 rather than emending to 身."
    },
